def Xform "HubKnuckle" (
    prepend apiSchemas = ["PhysicsRigidBodyAPI", "PhysicsMassAPI"]
    doc = "Fixed front wheel hub, bearing housing and cast-iron steering knuckle in an installed wheel well. Origin: the rotor's hub centre (same as rotor.usda). The hub flange and five M12 wheel studs hold the rotor's hat; the upright carries a lower ball-joint boss, an upper strut clamp and a steering arm. The caliper bracket mounts to the upright. Sizes are representative of a 2001-05 VW Golf IV front knuckle (estimates, not catalogue dimensions); visual and collider shapes are fixed."
)
